  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Management Support for Health Sector Development Programme (HSDP) is a component of Health Sector Development Programme (HSDP) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;417,730. It works in the following sector(s): Basic health care, Reproductive health care, Health policy and administrative management, Family planning, Basic nutrition, Public finance management (PFM), Health personnel development.</narrative>
  </description>
